      "description": "Watch Celta Vigo vs Athletic Club highlights and goals from La Liga on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 30, 2026. On August 30, 2026 , Celta Vigo hosted Athletic Club in a La Liga clash that promised to test the tactical discipline of both managers. The atmosphere at the stadium was electric as two historic Spanish clubs looked to secure crucial points in the early stages of the season. The Quickfire Double The match took a decisive turn around the 20-minute mark when Athletic Club 's clinical edge came to the fore. Iñaki Williams turned provider, finding Alex Berenguer , who finished clinically with his right foot to break the deadlock. Before the home side could catch their breath, the visitors struck again. Just two minutes later, Iñigo Ruiz de Galarreta set up Robert Navarro , who doubled the lead with another precise right-footed strike, leaving the Celta Vigo defense shell-shocked after conceding twice in rapid succession. Tactical Shifts and Physicality Seeking a way back into the contest, Celta Vigo made a bold quadruple substitution at the start of the second half. The introduction of the legendary Iago Aspas , alongside Miguel Roman , Yoel Lago , and Javi Rueda , injected new energy into the side. However, the game became increasingly physical as the referee reached for his pocket. Yuri Berchiche , Robert Navarro , and Benat Gerenabarrena were all shown yellow cards for heavy challenges. While Celta controlled 53% of the possession, they struggled to dismantle a resilient Athletic backline that remained organized under pressure. Closing the Door In the final stages, Athletic Club managed the game professionally to protect their lead. Nico Williams was introduced from the bench to provide a threat on the counter-attack and nearly added a third goal in the 90th minute, only to see his effort go wide. Celta Vigo pushed forward desperately in stoppage time, but an offside call against Iago Aspas in the 93rd minute 